Which are all zeros of sin z in C?
(A) {kπ : k ∈ Z} (B) {ikπ : k ∈ Z}
(C) {2kπ : k ∈ Z} (D) {π/2 + kπ : k ∈ Z}
(E) {kπ + iℓπ : k, ℓ ∈ Z}

√
Put L = log(3 + 10). Which set gives all solutions of sin z = 3i?
(A) {kπ + iL : k ∈ Z}
(B) {2kπ ± iL : k ∈ Z}
(C) {2kπ + iL, (2k + 1)π − iL : k ∈ Z}
(D) There are no solutions.
(E) {π/2 + kπ + iL : k ∈ Z}
